  },
  "notes": "Official Kobelco Europe spec (CKE1350G-4; -3 datasheet not found on official site, -4 is the current version). Headline 150 t x 4.4 m requires auxiliary sheave (spec footnote). Source has 21 boom columns (15.2-76.2 m); every other column kept (11). Kobelco cells of the form \"R m/value\" (min/max radius of that boom) were added as extra radius rows at their exact radius, so many rows are sparse. Ratings per EN13000; hook block and slings must be deducted. counterweight_t = upper counterweight (carbody weight 10.8 t extra). Dims p.7 (mm): track overall length 7,895 (tumbler centres 6,890), width over 910 mm shoes 6,310, tail swing R5,500, boom foot 1,400 ahead of slew centre. trackGauge_m = 6.31 - 0.91 = 5.40 m (derived). Boom foot pin height not clearly dimensioned (2,525 mm dimension points near cab front) - left null."
